        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（校正者曰く、重複なるも姓名記載につき省略せず）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Proofreader's note, set in small type in five sub-columns above the Tsuruta block: \"The proofreader states: although this duplicates an earlier entry, it has not been omitted, because it records the personal names.\" The duplication is real — fascicle 8 already gives Tsuruta's councillor counts, and this fascicle-9 sheet adds the names behind them."
